        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As an additional result of focusing on building our portfolio of revenue-generating products and generating profitability, in fiscal 2023 we terminated our license agreements relating to Healight and NT0502 (N-desethyloxybutynin), and we indefinitely suspended active development of our clinical development programs including AR101 (enzastaurin) (“AR101”).",
