        "filing_date": "2025-09-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To reduce the costs associated with the manufacture of Adzenys and Cotempla we transferred the manufacturing of these products to a United States-based third-party manufacturer in the fourth quarter of fiscal 2024.",
